### Create report
POST http://localhost:3000/report
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "make": "Opel",
    "model": "Zafira",
    "year": 2010,
    "mileage": 270000,
    "lng": 45,
    "lat": 45,
    "price": 4000
}


### Change approval status of an existing report
PATCH http://localhost:3000/report/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "approved": true
}


### Get an estimate for an existing vehicle
GET http://localhost:3000/report?make=Opel&model=Zafira&year=2009&mileage=275000&lng=45&lat=45